# Public env vars are inlined at bundle time (restart Expo after changing .env).
#
# --- Expo 里用 WebView 打开的 Vite 店铺（frontend `npm run dev`，默认 5173）---
# 不设则开发模式会按 Metro 同源自动推断电脑 IP；真机建议写死：
# EXPO_PUBLIC_WEB_SHOP_URL=http://192.168.1.126:5173
#
# --- 仅当你写纯 RN 页面直连 API 时用（与 Vite 里 VITE_BACKEND_URL 是两回事）---
# Physical phone / tablet: localhost = the device, NOT your PC. Set your PC LAN IP (same Wi-Fi):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://192.168.1.100:4000
#
# Android emulator → host PC:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://10.0.2.2:4000
#
# USB debugging (Android): adb reverse tcp:4000 tcp:4000  then you may use:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:4000
#
# iOS simulator on Mac often works with:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:4000
#
# COPY this file to .env and set (uncomment) one line for your setup:
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_BACKEND_URL=http://192.168.1.100:4000
